WEBVTT

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:24.130
moo-shi

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:24.130
presents:

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:24.130
http://moo-shi.no-ip.info/ #moo-shi@irc.rizon.net

00:02:34.740 --> 00:02:35.830
<i>Hey, you!</i>

00:02:36.570 --> 00:02:38.090
<i>Get back here!</i>

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:57.270
Nice shot. I'd expect no less from
a specially-trained elite captain.

00:02:57.800 --> 00:03:01.150
<i>Don't get the wrong idea.
What I want to know...</i>

00:03:01.870 --> 00:03:04.690
<i>...is why you interrogated the
prisoners without permission.</i>

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:10.180
<i>I'm sorry, Master.
I told her about it...</i>

00:03:10.180 --> 00:03:13.820
<i>But I never imagined that
you were behind such cruelty!</i>

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:19.180
The enemy's behavior
just doesn't sit right with me.

00:03:19.180 --> 00:03:24.090
The prisoners said they were ordered
to take over the cargo and the car

00:03:24.090 --> 00:03:25.670
but leave it undamaged...

00:03:26.490 --> 00:03:28.920
A bit much just for some crap,
wouldn't you say?

00:03:30.660 --> 00:03:34.630
There's gotta be some reason
why you hafta be all secretive!

00:03:35.170 --> 00:03:38.170
<i>I told you everything I'm allowed to.</i>

00:03:38.170 --> 00:03:40.650
<i>You all agreed to that
when you took the job.</i>

00:03:44.130 --> 00:03:47.590
I expected as much. You're so stubborn...

00:03:48.790 --> 00:03:49.930
<i>Where are you going?</i>

00:03:49.930 --> 00:03:54.070
Recon. Don't worry, I won't
run off before I get my money.

00:03:54.490 --> 00:03:56.920
<i>- R-right!</i>

00:03:54.490 --> 00:03:56.920
- Let's go, Kosuna!

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:01.030
<i>Natsuko.</i>

00:04:02.510 --> 00:04:05.620
<i>It's not that we believe
what Kanta said, but...</i>

00:04:05.620 --> 00:04:10.110
<i>But... if you're carrying a
heavy burden all alone, then...</i>

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:15.770
<i>We're not assuming we can
take over it for you, but...</i>

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:17.100
<i>How do I put this...</i>

00:04:17.710 --> 00:04:23.090
<i>We want... to be useful to you.
Just keep that in mind...</i>

00:04:27.420 --> 00:04:28.690
<i>Thanks...</i>

00:04:35.760 --> 00:04:36.190
<i>Yes.</i>

00:04:37.220 --> 00:04:39.650
<i>Every last person is in position.</i>

00:04:39.650 --> 00:04:41.190
<i>Target shows no activity.</i>

00:04:41.190 --> 00:04:45.400
<i>Good. We wait until just
before the vacuum car is repaired.</i>

00:04:45.400 --> 00:04:46.150
<i>Keep watching it.</i>

00:04:46.950 --> 00:04:47.700
<i>Roger.</i>

00:04:50.780 --> 00:04:53.150
<i>What a relief...</i>

00:04:56.030 --> 00:04:59.830
<i>Huh? Not everyone's in position!</i>

00:05:02.450 --> 00:05:04.390
<i>You're a tiny one!</i>

00:05:04.850 --> 00:05:05.900
Moron!

00:05:07.390 --> 00:05:10.990
<i>Damn it! It's you, Sunabouzu!</i>

00:05:12.450 --> 00:05:13.840
Cry all you want!

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:16.720
It's your fault for
lowering your guard, dumbass!

00:05:16.720 --> 00:05:21.320
<i>Using a prisoner's mask to sneak over...
You sure are smart, Master!</i>

00:05:21.320 --> 00:05:23.860
<i>I forgot that you lack common sense!</i>

00:05:23.860 --> 00:05:27.650
<i>To think you would just come
waltzing in during all of this!</i>

00:05:27.650 --> 00:05:31.200
Actually, I only came to
check out the situation here,

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:34.670
but then I found some idiot
sitting back and relaxing!

00:05:35.740 --> 00:05:37.770
<i>W-what is that?!</i>

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:40.680
Some drug I found in the vacuum car...

00:05:40.680 --> 00:05:42.720
<i>D-don't tell me that's...</i>

00:05:42.720 --> 00:05:45.240
<i>...the stuff that makes you spill
your guts about everything?!</i>

00:05:46.550 --> 00:05:50.800
I hear the wrong dosage can make
bad stuff happen, but don't worry!

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:53.230
<i>OK, I'll talk! Ask me anything!</i>

00:05:53.230 --> 00:05:56.260
You sure are nice when you're docile!

00:05:56.260 --> 00:05:58.690
You go take care of the jammer!

00:05:58.690 --> 00:06:00.160
<i>Right!</i>

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:01.190
Now, then...

00:06:01.930 --> 00:06:04.930
Say you're after the crap now
and I'll kill you.

00:06:04.930 --> 00:06:06.580
What're you guys after?!

00:06:08.410 --> 00:06:10.750
<i>You ever heard of D-9?</i>

00:06:11.610 --> 00:06:14.880
The ruins in the lawless region
on the boundary

00:06:14.880 --> 00:06:17.380
between the West Oasis and South Oasis?

00:06:17.380 --> 00:06:21.600
<i>Apparently, there was a
new discovery there recently...</i>

00:06:23.050 --> 00:06:26.520
<i>...but the excavation team
was slaughtered by bandits.</i>

00:06:26.520 --> 00:06:29.330
And they took the treasure too, huh?

00:06:29.330 --> 00:06:32.460
<i>The South Oasis army chased them,</i>

00:06:32.460 --> 00:06:37.520
<i>but had to give up near
West Oasis Water Station #40...</i>

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:39.660
Water Station #40?

00:06:41.300 --> 00:06:44.670
That's the first place we
vacuumed after we got hired!

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:49.150
<i>It's only a rumor, but word has it
that what they discovered there</i>

00:06:49.150 --> 00:06:53.120
<i>was a stockpile of
genocide weapons so powerful</i>

00:06:53.120 --> 00:06:57.020
<i>they make current chemical and
biological weapons look like toys...</i>

00:06:58.490 --> 00:07:00.840
Weapons from the Dark Age?!

00:07:15.670 --> 00:07:17.340
<i>It's only rumor, though.</i>

00:07:17.340 --> 00:07:20.780
Don't tell me you're back here
'cause you're scared of them?

00:07:20.780 --> 00:07:21.650
<i>Maybe...</i>

00:07:22.850 --> 00:07:25.580
I-it does have some
ring of truth to it...

00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:29.160
Last question... Who hired you?!

00:07:31.850 --> 00:07:33.760
I bet I can guess.

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:38.290
The South Oasis found a bunch
of genocide weapons, if I recall.

00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:44.740
But I guess the West Oasis found out
and sent fake bandits to butt in...

00:07:46.670 --> 00:07:50.670
<i>Amagumo-san! It's weird!
The jamming signal stopped!</i>

00:07:50.670 --> 00:07:52.560
<i>The batteries should still work...</i>

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:58.250
<i>I-I'll check it out.
Continue your watch.</i>

00:07:58.250 --> 00:07:59.520
<i>Understood.</i>

00:07:59.950 --> 00:08:04.520
<i>Master! I did it!
I destroyed the transmitter!</i>

00:08:04.520 --> 00:08:07.260
<i>And I got the weapons they took!</i>

00:08:07.260 --> 00:08:09.090
Oh!

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:16.880
This feel! How I adore it so!

00:08:20.870 --> 00:08:22.070
Crap...

00:08:23.010 --> 00:08:24.100
<i>Damn you!</i>

00:08:32.380 --> 00:08:36.320
Dammit! I was sure I did
a thorough body search!

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:37.770
<i>S-sorry!</i>

00:08:40.420 --> 00:08:42.220
This ain't over yet!

00:08:46.450 --> 00:08:47.940
<i>Damn! Blinders!</i>

00:08:47.940 --> 00:08:50.970
<i>Are those S-2 Anti-Recons?!</i>

00:08:50.970 --> 00:08:53.320
<i>We're being raided! Retaliate!</i>

00:08:57.770 --> 00:09:00.480
<i>- We're totally surrounded!
- What happened to Kanta?!</i>

00:09:00.480 --> 00:09:03.310
<i>Don't be puttin' any
trust in that bastard!</i>

00:09:06.580 --> 00:09:07.680
Do you read me?!

00:09:07.680 --> 00:09:09.450
<i>Kanta?! Where are you?!</i>

00:09:09.450 --> 00:09:10.890
Enemy headquarters.

00:09:10.890 --> 00:09:14.560
Though it's quite empty now
that everyone's gone to see you...

00:09:15.100 --> 00:09:17.230
We trashed the electronic jammer.

00:09:17.230 --> 00:09:19.670
You should probably call for help now.

00:09:19.670 --> 00:09:22.470
<i>I don't remember taking orders from you!</i>

00:09:22.470 --> 00:09:24.350
OK. Have fun dying.

00:09:33.240 --> 00:09:35.710
<i>We don't need to go, Master?</i>

00:09:35.710 --> 00:09:39.510
You saw how good they are.
There'd be no point in going now.

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:41.580
<i>T-then...</i>

00:09:43.050 --> 00:09:45.470
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:09:45.980 --> 00:09:49.350
I intend to finish this job to a T.

00:09:50.990 --> 00:09:53.690
And I set something up
to ensure that happens...

00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:56.460
<i>I see...</i>

00:10:18.550 --> 00:10:21.380
<i>Amagumo-san. We can't find it anywhere.</i>

00:10:21.380 --> 00:10:24.560
<i>Are you sure it's not inside the tank?</i>

00:10:24.560 --> 00:10:27.560
<i>I guess we can't be sure
until things calm down...</i>

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:31.170
<i>No matter. We did all
we were told to do.</i>

00:10:31.170 --> 00:10:31.790
<i>Um...</i>

00:10:32.970 --> 00:10:37.540
<i>Can't we do something about this?
We can't even move an inch...</i>

00:10:37.540 --> 00:10:42.920
<i>Don't look at me. The Sunabouzu
took off with our truck...</i>

00:10:42.920 --> 00:10:45.510
<i>Taking this car is the only way.</i>

00:10:45.510 --> 00:10:48.430
<i>That damn Kanta
chickened out halfway through!</i>

00:10:53.290 --> 00:10:55.400
<i>Holding us hostage won't have any effect!</i>

00:10:56.280 --> 00:10:57.860
<i>We'll see about that...</i>

00:10:57.860 --> 00:10:59.910
<i>Sand cloud on the horizon!</i>

00:10:59.910 --> 00:11:03.760
<i>Multiple combat vehicles...
Probably the West Oasis Pursuit Unit!</i>

00:11:05.330 --> 00:11:08.040
<i>So you did call for reinforcements...</i>

00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:09.140
<i>Even so...</i>

00:11:09.140 --> 00:11:12.680
<i>However powerful they may be,
they cannot attack head-on!</i>

00:11:12.680 --> 00:11:15.630
<i>Just as we couldn't before...</i>

00:11:16.580 --> 00:11:20.880
<i>We hold a stockpile of the deadliest,
most powerful genocide weapons.</i>

00:11:20.880 --> 00:11:23.370
<i>Speeding along is their one choice only!</i>

00:11:23.690 --> 00:11:25.710
<i>Only! Only! Only! Only!</i>

00:11:25.710 --> 00:11:26.820
<i>- Obstacle ahead!</i>

00:11:27.460 --> 00:11:28.990
<i>It's the stolen truck!</i>

00:11:28.990 --> 00:11:29.760
<i>What?!</i>

00:11:35.120 --> 00:11:36.570
<i>Sunabouzu...</i>

00:11:37.500 --> 00:11:40.240
<i>Taking it back with
only one machine gun?</i>

00:11:40.240 --> 00:11:45.200
<i>I didn't peg you as the kind to attack
when there's no hope of winning...</i>

00:11:45.200 --> 00:11:48.260
<i>...but you know when
to come at a bad time!</i>

00:11:50.810 --> 00:11:54.020
<i>Driver! Don't stop, no matter what!</i>

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:56.990
<i>Artillery! Clean up the trash ahead!</i>

00:11:57.410 --> 00:11:58.070
<i>Roger!</i>

00:12:08.600 --> 00:12:09.870
<i>What the?</i>

00:12:09.870 --> 00:12:11.720
<i>That's my machine gun...</i>

00:12:11.720 --> 00:12:14.430
<i>- What's going on?!
- The Sunabouzu is up ahead!</i>

00:12:14.430 --> 00:12:17.400
<i>What's he doing now?</i>

00:12:20.540 --> 00:12:21.810
- What?!

00:12:20.540 --> 00:12:21.810
<i>- Master!</i>

00:12:21.810 --> 00:12:24.650
<i>You're going to shoot the bomb
you planted down there?!</i>

00:12:24.650 --> 00:12:26.160
Sure am!

00:12:26.160 --> 00:12:31.240
<i>B-but what if the shock does something
to all those deadly weapons?!</i>

00:12:32.020 --> 00:12:34.960
Then friend and foe go bye-bye together!

00:12:34.960 --> 00:12:39.170
But don't worry! I only planted
enough to blow the electrical wiring!

00:12:39.170 --> 00:12:43.430
Just get shooting! If we
can stop its legs, we win!

00:12:45.800 --> 00:12:50.340
<i>Sunabouzu... What are you up to?</i>

00:12:50.340 --> 00:12:52.830
<i>Blast 'em to bits!</i>

00:13:13.000 --> 00:13:14.620
<i>W-what the?!</i>

00:13:16.970 --> 00:13:20.450
<i>Yes! We did it! We did it, Master!</i>

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:22.560
Huh?

00:13:23.010 --> 00:13:24.130
<i>Master?</i>

00:13:36.060 --> 00:13:39.940
<i>You fool! The most powerful
genocide weapons are on board!</i>

00:13:43.090 --> 00:13:46.930
I screwed up the
amount of explosives!

00:14:13.820 --> 00:14:14.790
<i>Ow!</i>

00:14:25.010 --> 00:14:26.740
<i>It's the same...</i>

00:14:28.740 --> 00:14:33.080
<i>Those feelings... And my misery...</i>

00:14:33.080 --> 00:14:35.110
<i>It's because I wasn't strong...</i>

00:14:37.410 --> 00:14:40.390
<i>So I studied my absolute hardest...</i>

00:14:41.180 --> 00:14:42.930
<i>I wanted to be strong...</i>

00:14:43.250 --> 00:14:45.040
<i>I endured the discrimination...</i>

00:14:45.040 --> 00:14:49.650
<i>And worked so hard while
giving up so much, and yet!</i>

00:14:57.860 --> 00:15:00.240
<i>- Hurry up!
- It's all slippery with shit!</i>

00:15:00.240 --> 00:15:01.230
<i>Bastards!</i>

00:15:05.020 --> 00:15:05.940
<i>Bro!</i>

00:15:05.940 --> 00:15:07.530
<i>Why won't you just die?!</i>

00:15:07.530 --> 00:15:09.100
<i>His side! He's hurt there!</i>

00:15:10.310 --> 00:15:11.960
<i>Talk about careless!</i>

00:15:11.960 --> 00:15:13.980
<i>Quit sittin' on your asses!</i>

00:15:13.980 --> 00:15:16.500
<i>Say what?! Who needs your help?!</i>

00:15:18.380 --> 00:15:19.920
<i>- Bastards!
- You idiot!</i>

00:15:20.820 --> 00:15:23.760
<i>Don't shoot!
The shit'll make 'em misfire!</i>

00:15:25.430 --> 00:15:26.830
<i>I can't breathe!</i>

00:15:26.830 --> 00:15:28.960
<i>Oh no! Get your helmets off!</i>

00:15:28.960 --> 00:15:32.230
<i>You'll suffocate if
the shit gets in your cooler!</i>

00:15:44.110 --> 00:15:48.690
<i>- Smells like crap!
- My nose!</i>

00:15:48.690 --> 00:15:52.350
<i>Our noses got screwed up long ago!</i>

00:15:52.350 --> 00:15:55.830
<i>I guess the first ones
to get used to it win!</i>

00:15:56.790 --> 00:15:59.370
<i>- Eat shit!
- Shit!</i>

00:16:02.260 --> 00:16:04.200
<i>This isn't good...</i>

00:16:05.300 --> 00:16:07.040
<i>But...</i>

00:16:11.230 --> 00:16:17.400
<i>With the special unit girl... I can
shed light on the West Oasis' crime.</i>

00:16:22.450 --> 00:16:23.600
<i>I refuse to lose! Bring it on!</i>

00:16:23.600 --> 00:16:25.100
<i>Girl!</i>

00:16:34.360 --> 00:16:34.960
<i>Why, you!</i>

00:16:44.510 --> 00:16:47.130
<i>I just love women with spunk.</i>

00:16:57.750 --> 00:16:58.590
<i>Brother!</i>

00:16:59.790 --> 00:17:03.610
<i>Natsuko, our sister,
isn't going anywhere!</i>

00:17:08.560 --> 00:17:10.780
<i>H-here they come!</i>

00:17:12.430 --> 00:17:15.000
<i>It's the West Oasis Pursuit Unit!</i>

00:17:21.510 --> 00:17:23.020
<i>This isn't good...</i>

00:17:29.950 --> 00:17:31.210
<i>He got away!</i>

00:17:32.420 --> 00:17:33.580
<i>B-Bro!</i>

00:17:34.560 --> 00:17:35.870
<i>Bro! How bad is it?!</i>

00:17:36.560 --> 00:17:38.720
<i>It's nothin' much...</i>

00:17:38.720 --> 00:17:40.490
<i>I'm so sorry...</i>

00:17:42.260 --> 00:17:45.910
<i>It's because... I was careless...</i>

00:17:56.450 --> 00:18:01.610
<i>What was I so upset about?</i>

00:18:02.690 --> 00:18:06.560
<i>I hated Kanta... I wanted to get strong...</i>

00:18:06.560 --> 00:18:10.160
<i>I was scared of being
a burden on everyone...</i>

00:18:10.160 --> 00:18:12.790
<i>I was scared of being left behind...</i>

00:18:13.860 --> 00:18:18.730
<i>All I did was go around and
around in circles... I'm ridiculous...</i>

00:18:32.350 --> 00:18:33.520
<i>Kanta!</i>

00:18:33.520 --> 00:18:36.860
<i>Bastard hid until it was all over!</i>

00:18:36.860 --> 00:18:39.000
<i>Kanta! This is your fault!</i>

00:18:39.000 --> 00:18:42.170
<i>Yeah! You made Natsu-neechan cry!</i>

00:18:42.170 --> 00:18:43.930
How's it my fault?!

00:18:43.930 --> 00:18:46.330
<i>You just had to do things your way!</i>

00:18:55.470 --> 00:18:57.010
<i>That felt good!</i>

00:19:01.810 --> 00:19:03.550
<i>U-um...</i>

00:19:03.550 --> 00:19:07.820
<i>He and Natsuko-san WEREN'T
good childhood friends?</i>

00:19:07.820 --> 00:19:09.850
<i>Hell no!</i>

00:19:09.850 --> 00:19:14.110
<i>All he ever did was get us
involved in trouble!</i>

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:17.730
<i>And to top it all off!</i>

00:19:17.730 --> 00:19:21.870
<i>Please! Stop asking them
to do bad things!</i>

00:19:21.870 --> 00:19:25.870
It's 'cause they're always picking
fights with me that I take 'em on.

00:19:26.440 --> 00:19:30.010
I don't really care since
it's just to pass the time,

00:19:30.010 --> 00:19:35.460
but what'll you do to help make up
for all my extra time if I stop?

00:19:39.210 --> 00:19:45.470
<i>Eh?! She had to let him fondle her
breasts everyday to pass the time?!</i>

00:19:45.470 --> 00:19:48.760
<i>Natsuko sacrificed herself for us...</i>

00:19:48.760 --> 00:19:51.530
I'm sure Natsuko-chan liked it too!

00:19:51.530 --> 00:19:53.530
<i>And then he finally...</i>

00:19:53.530 --> 00:19:55.130
<i>What did you do?!</i>

00:19:55.130 --> 00:20:00.300
Nothin'. I tried to, but she ran off!

00:20:00.300 --> 00:20:02.200
<i>Unbelievable!</i>

00:20:02.200 --> 00:20:06.450
<i>After we found out and kicked
his ass to get him to stop...</i>

00:20:07.590 --> 00:20:12.470
<i>...he planted a bomb in our
outhouse to get back at us!</i>

00:20:14.380 --> 00:20:16.440
<i>It was Natsuko who set it off...</i>

00:20:17.070 --> 00:20:20.660
<i>After that, her personality
changed completely!</i>

00:20:20.660 --> 00:20:24.560
<i>The once-gentle Natsuko
who loved her family and brothers</i>

00:20:24.560 --> 00:20:29.680
<i>quit doing chores and clung to her desk
as she did nothing but study!</i>

00:20:31.430 --> 00:20:34.340
<i>It's because I'm a girl!
Because I'm weak!</i>

00:20:34.340 --> 00:20:37.990
<i>It's because I'm ignorant
that I always get screwed over!</i>

00:20:38.670 --> 00:20:40.360
<i>That's horrible!</i>

00:20:41.740 --> 00:20:44.310
You don't have any proof it was me!

00:20:44.310 --> 00:20:46.650
<i>That sweat is more proof than anything!</i>

00:20:46.650 --> 00:20:49.410
Everyone was mean
when they were a kid!

00:20:53.090 --> 00:20:53.740
<i>Yes.</i>

00:20:54.090 --> 00:20:55.560
<i>Kawaguchi here.</i>

00:20:55.560 --> 00:20:58.250
<i>Operation complete.
The cargo is delivered.</i>

00:20:58.250 --> 00:21:02.790
<i>Understood. We were ambushed,
but fought back and routed them.</i>

00:21:03.430 --> 00:21:05.130
<i>There's no need to pursue.</i>

00:21:05.130 --> 00:21:06.870
<i>So we've reached an agreement?</i>

00:21:06.870 --> 00:21:10.440
<i>Return to headquarters.
Your mission is complete.</i>

00:21:10.440 --> 00:21:11.700
<i>Understood.</i>

00:21:12.570 --> 00:21:15.520
So we were decoys, in other words?

00:21:16.340 --> 00:21:19.210
You said you reached an agreement...

00:21:19.210 --> 00:21:21.520
Meaning you struck
a deal with the enemy?!

00:21:21.520 --> 00:21:25.400
Damn it! I risked my life
and got covered in shit...

00:21:25.400 --> 00:21:26.760
<i>It's hilarious.</i>

00:21:26.760 --> 00:21:29.890
<i>I always get covered in crap
when you're involved.</i>

00:21:29.890 --> 00:21:31.760
<i>You're something else.</i>

00:21:31.760 --> 00:21:32.890
<i>But...</i>

00:21:32.890 --> 00:21:37.010
<i>I don't know what you found out
when you left to do reconnaissance,</i>

00:21:37.010 --> 00:21:40.500
<i>but don't stick your nose
into this any further.</i>

00:21:42.570 --> 00:21:46.920
<i>Oh, and since you failed your job,
your payment will be cut in half.</i>

00:21:49.580 --> 00:21:51.250
Why, you little...

00:21:51.250 --> 00:21:53.910
<i>Assassination. We can assassinate.</i>

00:21:55.580 --> 00:22:00.590
<i>And so the most powerful genocide
weapons the world has ever known</i>

00:22:00.590 --> 00:22:06.410
<i>began being jointly developed in secret
by the West and South Oases.</i>

00:22:07.010 --> 00:22:10.600
<i>Ten or so years later,
the Sunabouzu would experience them</i>

00:22:10.600 --> 00:22:14.540
<i>in an even ghastlier form.</i>

00:22:16.170 --> 00:22:17.840
<i>Damned government!</i>

00:22:17.840 --> 00:22:22.710
<i>I refuse to remain
a pawn in your game!</i>

00:23:56.000 --> 00:24:00.100
<i>- Kosuna! You stink like crazy!
- You still reek of shit too!</i>

00:24:00.100 --> 00:24:02.240
<i>Hey, don't give me
lines like that! Seriously!</i>

00:24:02.240 --> 00:24:03.810
<i>Shit! Shit! Shit! Shit!</i>

00:24:03.810 --> 00:24:05.670
<i>You know you do it too!</i>

00:24:05.670 --> 00:24:07.440
<i>Next episode- "Junko and Pursuer"</i>

00:24:07.440 --> 00:24:10.680
<i>Miss it and I'll sue you for
sexual harassment in the studio!</i>
